      "why_read": "This article introduces the Chief of Staff pattern for orchestrating AI coding agents. Readers will learn how separating orchestration from execution, utilizing durable state, and verifying agent claims can significantly improve the reliability of long-running AI coding tasks.",
      "authors": [
